Missing appSettings: MessageConverterURL

comes from this code:

var v = ConfigurationManager.AppSettings[key];
But we moved MessageConverterURL OUT of appSettings into:
===================

private static string ReadConfig(string key)

is now reading from the wrong place.

===================
Replace this:
private static string ReadConfig(string key)
{
    var v = ConfigurationManager.AppSettings[key];

    if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(v))
    {
        throw new Exception("Missing appSettings: " + key);
    }

    return v;
}
